● The plan
  Stream rows through a JSON writer behind the existing exporter trait.

  Workflow  council · Peers draft plans blind and debate only where they disagree
    A security-labeled API feature: blind drafts and cross-judging fit it.
    goal (up to 2 rounds) → plan (up to 3 rounds) → build → merge
    Goal: loop until goal_approved, at most 2 (restate, differ, goal approval)
    Plan: loop until plan_decided, at most 3 (draft ×3, blind, judge, when drafts_disagree, plan approval)
    Build: build worker
    Merge: merge

